less power  there's hardly a trace of turbo lag in  many turbocharged engine the power kicks  in only after a delay and that's a big  plus the engine also has a beautiful  sound it's relatively muted but gets  nice and throaty when you really fire it  up so whether you choose the practical  tour with it's easily folded down rear  seats or opt for the sporty gtc you can  treat yourself to one of the new engines  we tested
 

